      "writtenOn": "2023-01-27T15:59:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we want to set `fRPSeeded \u003d true` here to avoid re-seeding, on the off chance that someone has a legitimate need to `apply` the same matrix twice? \n\nThe function is marked `const` now; I\u0027m not sure if this will be a huge ripple effect to change. If un-consting is hard, it might be OK to guard against this in some other way (if we could assert that the RP isn\u0027t seeded yet, for instance? this would require an O(n) scan of the RP stage list, unfortunately)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
