      "writtenOn": "2023-01-27T16:20:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Honestly, this seems like overkill to me given what this currently represents: a snapshot in time when appendStages() is called. I thought about making it mutable and setting it to true here, but then it starts to feel like the object is a ongoing tracker of state rather than a snapshot, in which case fPendingMatrix should also be reset to identity here.\n\nWe could make it actually be that and thread it down through appendStages by * rather than const\u0026. I think in that case concat() would modify the existing MatrixRec rather than return a new one.\n\nI\u0027m happy to try making that modification to see if we like it better.",
      "parentUuid": "c9517add_0d738f2d",
